        "desc": "西风骑士团大团长，守护蒙德的北风骑士。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2026/02/21/553feb81c3bbc5e3bc69a765e157c33f_8250978205515428490.png",
