        "epId": 4774,
        "name": "闲云",
        "desc": "<p>绝云仙众「三眼五显仙人」之一，雅号「留云借风真君」。擅使机关奇术，心向红尘烟火，正以「闲云」之名行走人间。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/01/30/157749474/2c2be27f8876e9435ab8c8b933b8408c_1095051365963510492.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2968,
        "name": "流浪者",
        "desc": "<p>身份成谜的流浪人士。衣着打扮像是修验者，言行却并不是修验者应有的模样。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/12/06/36540823/24d97a22be742fb732ea96f625d1faac_8403570345904252714.png",
